Package: dtatools
Title: Read and Write Stata Files with Stata's Missing Values
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Bearak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jbearak@guttmacher.org")
Description: Reads and writes Stata .dta files through dtaparser,
    keeping Stata's extended missing values, value labels and
    comparison rules.
